---
          ╭────────────────────────────────────────────── help ──────────────────────────────────────────────╮          
          │  Global                                                                                          │          
          │    ctrl+p             open command palette                                                       │          
          │    ?                  show this help                                                             │          
          │    ctrl+c             quit                                                                       │          
          │  Panes                                                                                           │          
          │    ← / →              move focus between panes                                                   │          
          │    tab / shift+tab    cycle panes                                                                │          
          │    ctrl+← / ctrl+→    move pane focus (ctrl+→ opens the selected chat)                           │          
          │  Chat list                                                                                       │          
          │    ↑ / ↓              move selection                                                             │          
          │    ⏎                  open chat                                                                  │          
          │    /                  filter chats                                                               │          
          │    a                  toggle archive                                                             │          
          │    [ / ]              cycle folders                                                              │          
          │  Composer                                                                                        │          
          │    type               write a message                                                            │          
          │    ⏎                  send                                                                       │          
          │    alt+⏎              insert newline                                                             │          
          │    ↑ (empty input)    enter selection mode                                                       │          
          │    /send <path>       send a file                                                                │          
          │  Selection mode                                                                                  │          
          │    ↑ / ↓              move highlighted message                                                   │          
          │    ← / →              move focused action chip                                                   │          
          │    ⏎                  invoke focused chip                                                        │          
          │    r f e c d x l o s  chip shortcuts: reply forward react copy edit delete download open resend  │          
          │    ctrl+←             back to the chat list                                                      │          
          │    esc                back to composer                                                           │          
          │  Modal                                                                                           │          
          │    esc                dismiss                                                                    │          
          │    ⏎                  confirm                                                                    │          
          │  Search                                                                                          │          
          │    /                  open message search (from selection mode)                                  │          
          │    type               search query                                                               │          
          │    ⏎                  run search                                                                 │          
          │    n / N              next / previous hit                                                        │          
          │    esc                close search                                                               │          
          │                                                                                                  │          
          │  esc close                                                                                       │          
          ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
